{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":504608,"name":"Ric T","username":"Ric_T","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/bbe5ce/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-10-01T08:27:41.415Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504608-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504608-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504608-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504608-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProduct: Grok Bot desktop\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: Ubuntu 25.10\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot: v0.63.0 (latest apt candidate)\u003cbr\u003e\nBug: Bot Description / Instructions field missing on Ubuntu desktop.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504608-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504608-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClicking the bot name in chat opens a right panel with avatar, Name, Label, Details, Library, Computer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo Bot settings → Description field to view/set what a bot does.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe description is not lost. Existing bot’s I had already created print their original ‘Description’ when asked.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504608-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504608-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn desktop, open chat with bot → click bot name in chat header → Bot settings → Description\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAs per \u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/help/grok-bot/edit-bot\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eChange a Bot's name, picture, and description | Cursor Docs\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504608-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504608-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLinux\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504608-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504608-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion: 0.63.0\u003cbr\u003e\nBuilt: 2026-09-29T18:01:13.782Z\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: linux\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-504608-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-504608-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-10-01T10:57:25.474Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":17,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":86.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":173483,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-description-field-missing-on-ubuntu-desktop","display_username":"Ric T","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://cursor.com/help/grok-bot/edit-bot","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Change a Bot's name, picture, and description | Cursor Docs","clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140472,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-description-field-missing-on-ubuntu-desktop/173483/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":504717,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-10-01T10:57:06.269Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou described it correctly. The app and the help article don’t match right now. The details panel for personal bots was redesigned recently, and in the new layout there’s no separate Bot settings page with a Description field anymore. Instead, you’ll see Details / Library / Computer. This isn’t Ubuntu-specific and it’s not related to your setup. Everyone on desktop has the same layout right now.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a known issue we’re tracking, including the docs mismatch. I’ve shared your report with the team. I can’t give a timeline yet, but I’ll reply in the thread once there’s an update.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso, thanks for noting that existing bots still speak their original Description. That’s a useful detail, and I passed it along.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-10-01T10:57:06.269Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":173483,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-description-field-missing-on-ubuntu-desktop","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_reco